# ============================================================================
# PLACEHOLDER — NOT A REAL KEY. OTA verification FAILS CLOSED on this file.
# ============================================================================
# This file is the baked-in trust anchor the orchestrator's update agent
# uses to verify cosign-signed OTA release manifests (WARP-534/535/537).
#
# It MUST be replaced with the REAL cosign public key via the human key
# ceremony documented in scripts/README.md ("OTA release signing — key
# ceremony"). In short:
#
#   cosign generate-key-pair                      # run locally, NOT in CI
#   gh secret set COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY < cosign.key
#   gh secret set COSIGN_PASSWORD                 # the key-encryption pass
#   cp cosign.pub apps/orchestrator/src/services/update-agent/cosign.pub
#   rm cosign.key                                 # never commit, never keep
#
# The update agent's verify path (update-agent/verify.ts) detects the
# DROPLET-OTA-PLACEHOLDER marker below — and the absence of a PEM PUBLIC
# KEY block — and refuses to verify ANY manifest until the real key lands.
# Do not remove the marker without completing the ceremony.
# ============================================================================
DROPLET-OTA-PLACEHOLDER-NOT-A-KEY
